OL,3,GNEWSACardboard tower sculpture toppled
OL,4,Aafter wind hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses ensured the site was safe so
OL,7,Fpeople could watch it happen. When the
OL,8,F20m (66ft) structure finally fell,
OL,9,Fabout 300 members of the community in
OL,10,Fthe park helped with some "monumental
OL,11,Fjumping and squashing" to prepare it
OL,12,Ffor transportation and its recycling,
OL,13,Fthey added.
